{
  // Owning TypeScript program for the specs listed in `include`: the ones whose `no-unsafe-*`
  // diagnostics were cleared by giving them a program. Without a matching project, tsgolint
  // reports `Got tsconfig for file ...: <none>` / `Total programs: 0`, and every Node builtin
  // (`node:fs/promises`, `node:path`, ...) and `process` access in an unmatched spec resolves to
  // an `error` typed value — which is what the type-aware `no-unsafe-*` rules then flag.
  //
  // The list is explicit rather than a glob because the directory is not clean as a program:
  // `pnpm exec tsc -p apps/vscode-dsh/tests/tsconfig.json --noEmit` reports 171 errors for the
  // twelve files below, while a probe of the same base over the whole directory (the file
  // `{"extends": "../../../tsconfig.base.json", "include": ["**/*.ts"]}` written into this
  // directory) reports 460. This program is private to the lint contract — no `references` graph in
  // the repository names it — so the rest of the directory's lint baseline stays with the
  // repository-wide debt (DEBT-019) and is deliberately absent here.
  //
  // It is not a claim about the directory: the criterion is "a spec whose `no-unsafe-*`
  // diagnostics were cleared by giving it a program", not "every clean spec" and not "every
  // Phase-3 spec". `interaction-approval-resolution.spec.ts` is a Phase-3 spec that stays out
  // because it already reports zero diagnostics without a program (probe:
  // `npx tsx scripts/run-oxlint.ts apps/vscode-dsh/tests/interaction-approval-resolution.spec.ts`),
  // and several other specs in this directory are also clean without one (`auto-start-orchestrator`,
  // `timeline-projector`, `conversation-registry`, ...) — reproducible check:
  // `npx tsx scripts/run-oxlint.ts apps/vscode-dsh/tests` lists every file that still has any.
  // The three `spike-t0*` entries are Phase-2 spike specs admitted under the same criterion; they
  // contribute one error to the count above (`spike-t0a-replay-hydrator.ts:72`, a `SurfaceOp`
  // comparison with no overlap), which is recorded in the Phase-4 implementation summary.
  "extends": "../../../tsconfig.base.json",
  "compilerOptions": {
    "composite": false,
    "declaration": false,
    "declarationMap": false,
    "incremental": false,
    "noEmit": true,
    "rewriteRelativeImportExtensions": false
  },
  "include": [
    "host-diagnostics.spec.ts",
    "node-env-guard.spec.ts",
    "session-host.spec.ts",
    "layer-v-inject-disconnect.spec.ts",
    "sandbox-clean-state.spec.ts",
    "build-freshness.spec.ts",
    "artifact-index.spec.ts",
    "display-evidence.spec.ts",
    "display-evidence-shell.spec.ts",
    "spike-t0a-replay-hydrator.ts",
    "spike-t0a-replay-rebuild.spec.ts",
    "spike-t0b-continue-capability.spec.ts"
  ]
}
